<title>UK: Trinkaus and Burkhardt sets 500 mln mark 2-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus and Burkhardt sets 500 mln mark 2-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Trinkaus and Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TRINKAUS AND BURKHARDT</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 1M-LIBOR  MATURITY    08.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    08.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p> LISTING    DUES	DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
